 "source_instruction": "i need a pair of low rise yellow briefs in a large.",
 "query": "I stopped by the little community bakery on the corner on my walk over here this morning, and the whole shop smelled like warm cinnamon rolls and freshly baked sourdough that had just come out of the oven. The old guy who runs the place was handing out free little sample slices of a new apple oat bread he\u2019s been testing, and it was sweet but not cloying, with little chunks of baked apple and a sprinkle of oats on the crust that had the perfect crunch. A tiny golden retriever puppy was tied up out front, wiggling so hard its whole body shook every time someone walked past, and it kept trying to nudge people\u2019s hands for pets like it was convinced every single person on the sidewalk was there just to say hi to it. I\u2019ve heard the men\u2019s underwear that comes in the mid-rise style exists, in size large, with a total price point that lands under $20. I\u2019ve also heard it comes in that 122 shade, whatever color that is, I don\u2019t really remember the exact hue name off the top of my head right now.",
